OneiOS take18, userland/metal/patches/NativeMetal/0001: a compute pipeline rebuilt with its unset constants zero keeps
its function until the reflection is read.
Upstream: Droid-VM/NativeMetal 3c46b5e (wip/hackintosh, HuJK, 2026-11-08, MIT), cherry-picked onto b0d6a07 unchanged;
also picked by upstream OneiOS 3f65b1d.
What: newComputePipelineStateWithDescriptor:options:reflection:error: retries a kernel that reads an unset function
constant with those constants zero; the rebuilt function was held only inside the retry's block, ARC released it, and
the reflection then read the released function (Function::clone at address 0).
Why: cameracaptured's CCPortrait precompilation died with SIGSEGV at 0 every boot on Droid-VM (symbolized:
nmb_compute_pipeline_reflection -> compute_descriptor -> Function::function_descriptor).
Switch: none (a crash fix). Removable: yes (ONEIOS_METAL_SKIP=compute-reflection-keeps-function); depends on nothing.

diff --git a/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm b/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm
index b21ef41..0f068f6 100644
--- a/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm
+++ b/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm
@@ -4808,9 +4808,12 @@ static void computeRefused(id<MTLFunction> function,NSString *why) {
  const NmbPipelineOptions creation={(uint64_t)options,archives.data(),archives.size()};
  const uint64_t pipelineBegan=nowUs();
  NmbComputePipeline *handle=nmb_compute_pipeline_new_with_descriptor(gDevice,&p,&creation);
- // Metal builds a kernel that reads a constant nobody set; the runtime refuses it: once more with those constants zero.
+ // Metal builds a kernel that reads a constant nobody set; the runtime refuses it: once more with those constants zero. The rebuilt
+ // function lives to the end of the call, as the reflection below reads its handle: held in the block alone, it went with the block,
+ // and the reflection read a released function (cameracaptured's CCPortrait kernels: SIGSEGV at 0 in the precompilation, every boot).
+ NBFunction *rebuilt=nil;
  if(!handle) {
-  NBFunction *rebuilt=zeroRestFunction((NBFunction *)d.computeFunction);
+  rebuilt=zeroRestFunction((NBFunction *)d.computeFunction);
   if(rebuilt){p.function=rebuilt.handle;handle=nmb_compute_pipeline_new_with_descriptor(gDevice,&p,&creation);}
  }
  gTimePipeline.add(pipelineBegan);
